{"id":"mesyats","lemma":"месяц","pos":"noun","rank":498,"glosses":["month","moon (in modern Russian usually referring to a crescent or a gibbous moon, but not a full moon)"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/a/a2/Ru-%D0%BC%D0%B5%D1%81%D1%8F%D1%86.ogg/Ru-%D0%BC%D0%B5%D1%81%D1%8F%D1%86.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"месяца","plural":"месяцы"},"examples":[{"text":"Дайте мне три месяца.","en":"Give me three months.","words":[{"g":"to give","l":"дать"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"я"},{"g":"three"},null]},{"text":"Какой сейчас месяц?","en":"What month is this?","words":[{"g":"what, what one"},{"g":"now"},null]},{"text":"Я работаю здесь три месяца.","en":"I've been working here three months.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to work","l":"работать"},{"g":"here"},{"g":"three"},null]},{"text":"Давай приходить сюда каждый месяц.","en":"Let's come here every month.","words":[{"g":"let's"},{"g":"to come , to arrive"},{"g":"here, hither"},{"g":"every, each"},null]},{"text":"Три месяца - это долго ждать.","en":"Three months is a long time to wait.","words":[{"g":"three"},null,{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"a long time"},{"g":"to wait for"}]}]}